        <updated>2026-09-02T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="resources_card"><div data-animate="slide-in" data-clip-sq="tl tr bl br" class="resources_card-visual-w" style=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a943633330bcb583ca6fdfc_blog%20banner%20blue%20(new)%20(1).avif" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a943633330bcb583ca6fdfc_blog%20banner%20blue%20(new)%20(1)-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a943633330bcb583ca6fdfc_blog%20banner%20blue%20(new)%20(1)-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a943633330bcb583ca6fdfc_blog%20banner%20blue%20(new)%20(1).avif 1039w" class="img_abs is-resources"></div><div class="resources_card-text"><div class="heading-with-p is-16 is-left is-grow"><div class="heading-with-p is-8 is-left"><div class="heading-with-p is-6 is-left"><div data-animate="slide-in" style="background-color: rgb(127, 197, 248); color: rgb(52, 12, 5);" class="resources_tag"><div fs-list-field="category">Blog</div></div><h3 fs-list-field="title" data-animate="slide-in" class="heading-style-h4 text-weight-normal" style="">Step into Amphi: One open arena for every stage of the cloud access lifecycle</h3></div><p fs-list-field="description" data-animate="slide-in" class="text-body text-style-2lines" style="">Introducing Amphi: a suite of free, open-source tools built to take the guesswork out of managing cloud access policies. The Amphi was built on a simple belief: the tools for getting access right should be out in the open, ready for any engineer to pick up and use.</p></div><div data-animate="slide-in" class="resources_author-w" style=""><div fs-list-field="author" class="text-caption text-color-grey-medium">Hadar Landau</div><div fs-list-field="date" class="text-caption text-color-disabled-grey">September 2, 2026</div></div></div></div><a aria-label="Read more" href="/resources/step-into-amphi-one-open-arena-for-every-stage-of-the-cloud-access-lifecycle" class="link_abs w-inline-block"></a></div>]]></content>
