        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="resources_card"><div data-animate="slide-in" data-clip-sq="tl tr bl br" class="resources_card-visual-w" style=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a968d1c3a8775338892493c_Introducing%20Policy%20Tester.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a968d1c3a8775338892493c_Introducing%20Policy%20Tester-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a968d1c3a8775338892493c_Introducing%20Policy%20Tester-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a968d1c3a8775338892493c_Introducing%20Policy%20Tester.avif 810w" class="img_abs is-resources"></div><div class="resources_card-text"><div class="heading-with-p is-16 is-left is-grow"><div class="heading-with-p is-8 is-left"><div class="heading-with-p is-6 is-left"><div data-animate="slide-in" style="background-color: rgb(127, 197, 248); color: rgb(52, 12, 5);" class="resources_tag"><div fs-list-field="category">Blog</div></div><h3 fs-list-field="title" data-animate="slide-in" class="heading-style-h4 text-weight-normal" style="">Fantastic AWS policies and where to find them</h3></div><p fs-list-field="description" data-animate="slide-in" class="text-body text-style-2lines" style="">You can’t secure what you can’t see. AWS has dozens of policy types scattered across dozens of services, regions, and accounts. IAM Collect is built to find them all. Answer your questions, secure your accounts, and protect your data.</p></div><div data-animate="slide-in" class="resources_author-w" style=""><div fs-list-field="author" class="text-caption text-color-grey-medium">David Kerber</div><div fs-list-field="date" class="text-caption text-color-disabled-grey">September 2, 2026</div></div></div></div><a aria-label="Read more" href="/resources/fantastic-aws-policies-and-where-to-find-them" class="link_abs w-inline-block"></a></div>]]>