    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Test S3 ABAC locally with IAM Lens]]></title>
        <id>https://act.security/resources/test-s3-abac-locally-with-iam-lens</id>
        <link href="https://act.security/resources/test-s3-abac-locally-with-iam-lens"/>
        <updated>2026-08-30T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="resources_card"><div data-animate="slide-in" data-clip-sq="tl tr bl br" class="resources_card-visual-w" style=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a968ccdef0aaf9967bee2fa_Introducing%20Policy%20Tester-2.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a968ccdef0aaf9967bee2fa_Introducing%20Policy%20Tester-2-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a968ccdef0aaf9967bee2fa_Introducing%20Policy%20Tester-2-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a968ccdef0aaf9967bee2fa_Introducing%20Policy%20Tester-2.avif 810w" class="img_abs is-resources"></div><div class="resources_card-text"><div class="heading-with-p is-16 is-left is-grow"><div class="heading-with-p is-8 is-left"><div class="heading-with-p is-6 is-left"><div data-animate="slide-in" style="background-color: rgb(127, 197, 248); color: rgb(52, 12, 5);" class="resources_tag"><div fs-list-field="category">Blog</div></div><h3 fs-list-field="title" data-animate="slide-in" class="heading-style-h4 text-weight-normal" style="">Test S3 ABAC locally with IAM Lens</h3></div><p fs-list-field="description" data-animate="slide-in" class="text-body text-style-2lines" style="">AWS just made managing access to S3 much more powerful, and a bit more complicated. S3 now supports attribute-based access control (ABAC) for general-purpose S3 buckets. With iam-lens, you can simulate and understand exactly how enabling ABAC on a bucket will affect access to a bucket before enabling it. Just add --s3-abac-override enabled to your simulate and who-can commands to see the effects of enabling ABAC on a bucket.</p></div><div data-animate="slide-in" class="resources_author-w" style=""><div fs-list-field="date" class="text-caption text-color-disabled-grey">August 30, 2026</div></div></div></div><a aria-label="Read more" href="/resources/test-s3-abac-locally-with-iam-lens" class="link_abs w-inline-block"></a></div>]]></content>
    </entry>
